   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Life satisfaction is evaluated differently across cultures. In some cultures, individual achievements and personal success are key factors, while in others, family well-being and social harmony are prioritized. Analyze how cultural values might influence life satisfaction during middle adulthood. Provide examples of how different cultures emphasize unique aspects of well-being and how these perspectives shape individual goals and priorities.",
